{"id":"326ba319ed196f03","group":"92","path":"92/92-fact-exponential-pr.md","title":"fact-exponential-pr — Exponential is Primitive Recursive","display":"fact-exponential-pr — Exponential is Primitive Recursive","type":"fact","metadata":{"type":"fact","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-fact-exponential-pr","aliases":["92-fact-exponential-pr"],"display":"fact-exponential-pr — Exponential is Primitive Recursive","depends_on":["[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","[[92-fact-multiplication-pr]]","[[92-df-successor-function]]","[[92-df-zero-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"fact"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-fact-exponential-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-fact-exponential-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"fact-exponential-pr — Exponential is Primitive Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9031faf8a1461cc3\" href=\"?note=9031faf8a1461cc3\" title=\"92-fact-multiplication-pr\">92-fact-multiplication-pr</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(\\exp : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (exponentiation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(x, y) = x^y\">\\(\\exp(x, y) = x^y\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive function class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8bff810dd710385a\" href=\"?note=8bff810dd710385a\" title=\"92-df-primitive-recursive\">92-df-primitive-recursive</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,Z=Z_1\">\\(S,Z=Z_1\\)</span> (successor and unary zero functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fadfd5a594e57bef\" href=\"?note=fadfd5a594e57bef\" title=\"92-df-successor-function\">92-df-successor-function</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"69750ae210519a25\" href=\"?note=69750ae210519a25\" title=\"92-df-zero-function\">92-df-zero-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\exp\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\exp\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>指数函数是原始递归的</li>\n<li>定义：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1\">\\(\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1\\)</span>（常数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>）</li>\n<li>递归步：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x\">\\(\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x\\)</span></li>\n<li>乘法是PR，因此指数是PR</li>\n<li>Gödel编码使用指数函数（幂次）</li>\n<li>标准素数幂Gödel编码还需素数枚举及相应解码函数的可计算性；指数为PR只是其中一个组成部分</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-multiplication-pr","status":"resolved","id":"9031faf8a1461cc3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-multiplication-pr]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-successor-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-zero-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"8bff810dd710385a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PR}$ (primitive-recursive function class, see [[92-df-primitive-recursive]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-successor-function","status":"resolved","id":"fadfd5a594e57bef","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,Z=Z_1$ (successor and unary zero functions, see [[92-df-successor-function]] and [[92-df-zero-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-zero-function","status":"resolved","id":"69750ae210519a25","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,Z=Z_1$ (successor and unary zero functions, see [[92-df-successor-function]] and [[92-df-zero-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\exp : \\mathbb{N} \\times \\mathbb{N} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(x, y) = x^y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"S,Z=Z_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}exponential\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\n\\exp\\in\\mathrm{PR}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1\\bigr)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\exp(x,0)=S(Z(x))=1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp(x,S(y))=\\exp(x,y)\\cdot x","display":false}],"bytes":1315,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["8bff810dd710385a","9031faf8a1461cc3","fadfd5a594e57bef","69750ae210519a25"]}